{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ova Magica combines the best of the JRPG, farming, and monster taming genres with life-sim elements - to bring you a content-rich game inspired by the classics!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BLOBS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect and train cute blob creatures. Ova Magica features an extensive crossbreeding system that allows you to create your very own unique blob  from millions of combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299170/extras/BlobBreedingSteam.gif?t=1745347834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many blobs can help you with everyday tasks or give you the upper hand in battles. A turtle blob is your best friend for watering crops, a cow blob produces milk and a bat blob helps you with bug catching. Collect all blobs to discover their unique abilities!    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FRIENDSHIP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299170/extras/AllCharacters.png?t=1745347834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Befriend 13 different characters, each with a unique story and personality! Deepen your relationship to unlock special events, items and buildings and help make Clover Town a better place!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FARMING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow several plants and trees! Sell the harvest, feed your blobs with it or use it to cook even better food! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299170/extras/Gif_FarmCrops620.gif?t=1745347834\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SEASONS + FESTIVALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play trough the main three seasons which all come with unique festivals, activities, blobs and crops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299170/extras/Spooky_Moon.gif?t=1745347834\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPEDITION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go on adventure into the blob worlds to find rare treasure and blob eggs. But be careful! The worlds change every time you enter and are roamed by wild blobs.\u00a0With great risk comes great reward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299170/extras/BlobWorldGates.gif?t=1745347834\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CRAFTING </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources to craft new useful blueprints with the workbench or decorate your farm and home!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299170/extras/Gif_Tools620.gif?t=1745347834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ova Magica has many more features that you can gradually discover as you progress through the game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1299170?t=1745347834","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299170/1d943a6218e8d0f95e0a9d5c5c5f5a917aff6a9a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745347834","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299170/faa5c47d69dff78f0759661f15771c05e5648027/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745347834","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299170/faa5c47d69dff78f0759661f15771c05e5648027/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745347834","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Early Access Languages</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ova Magica currently only supports <strong>English</strong>. Other languages are coming soon, which include German, Spanish, French, Japanese, and Simplified Chinese.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ova Magica combines the best of the JRPG, farming, and monster taming genres with life-sim elements - to bring you a content-rich game inspired by the classics!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BLOBS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect and train cute blob creatures. Ova Magica features an extensive crossbreeding system that allows you to create your very own unique blob  from millions of combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299170/extras/BlobBreedingSteam.gif?t=1745347834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many blobs can help you with everyday tasks or give you the upper hand in battles. A turtle blob is your best friend for watering crops, a cow blob produces milk and a bat blob helps you with bug catching. Collect all blobs to discover their unique abilities!    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FRIENDSHIP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299170/extras/AllCharacters.png?t=1745347834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Befriend 13 different characters, each with a unique story and personality! Deepen your relationship to unlock special events, items and buildings and help make Clover Town a better place!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FARMING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow several plants and trees! Sell the harvest, feed your blobs with it or use it to cook even better food! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299170/extras/Gif_FarmCrops620.gif?t=1745347834\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SEASONS + FESTIVALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play trough the main three seasons which all come with unique festivals, activities, blobs and crops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299170/extras/Spooky_Moon.gif?t=1745347834\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPEDITION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go on adventure into the blob worlds to find rare treasure and blob eggs. But be careful! The worlds change every time you enter and are roamed by wild blobs.\u00a0With great risk comes great reward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299170/extras/BlobWorldGates.gif?t=1745347834\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CRAFTING </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources to craft new useful blueprints with the workbench or decorate your farm and home!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299170/extras/Gif_Tools620.gif?t=1745347834\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ova Magica has many more features that you can gradually discover as you progress through the game!</p>","developers":["Skinny Frog","ClaudiaTheDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299170/68121ccc3c352d517acece328df1f5115db78763/header.jpg?t=1745347834","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Ova Magica (\u00a9) 2020 by ClaudiaTheDev. All Rights Reserved. Licensed exclusively to Top Hat Studios, Inc.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 14.04.2 64-bit / SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel, 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4